<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of second round, second leg</p>
<p>Italian Cup soccer matches on Wednesday:</p>
<p>In Perugia:</p>
<p>Perugia 1 (De Simone, 34th own goal) Nocerina 2 (Di Cara</p>
<p>5th, own goal, Battaglia 63rd)</p>
<p>Attendance: 5,000</p>
<p>Nocerina win 2-1 on aggregate</p>
<p>In Genoa:</p>
<p>Sampdoria 0 Genoa 2 (Morello 6th, Rutzittu 47th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 33,000</p>
<p>Genoa win 4-2 on aggregate</p>
</text>
